    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Meat Market</i> is a narrative-driven simulation game set in a post-apocalyptic world. After the murder of his daughter, the main character runs a butcher shop to earn money and take revenge. He captures people from the community that killed her, butchers them, and sells their body parts to zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This game contains excessive gore, dismemberment, and dark themes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coldwater</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A safe zone where what's left of humanity tries to rebuild civilization. Here, you can trade goods, decorate your home, and spend time in unique places like the local casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/52b10de82d0d30a9eab5f46964ce7aec.avif?t=1753195650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harrowpine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a peaceful town, now a hub for the undead. You run your butcher shop here\u2014capturing victims, processing them, and selling fresh human meat to hungry zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/ac49806311dafbeed7a54fb492c4fff2.avif?t=1753195650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ratwood</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rotting anarchist camp deep in the forest. The people who killed your daughter live here. Track them down, capture them, and drag them back to your shop to serve justice\u2026 and meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/c66286f8d1810fb94e46b51911e1fbc2.avif?t=1753195650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chop Your Victims</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture people from Ratwood, store them in prison cells, and prepare them for processing. Use chains and equipment to organize your butchering area efficiently.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/dfb0d232bae3e6eac8f7ec8f16c8c2e6.avif?t=1753195650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Butcher Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display body parts on your shelves and wait for the zombies to pay you in precious gold. Expand your shop with new sections, upgrade your equipment, and don\u2019t forget to add jars of eyeballs for that extra touch!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/51a3d18289cf4587d15141b32713153e.avif?t=1753195650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Meat Market</i> is a narrative-driven simulation game set in a post-apocalyptic world. After the murder of his daughter, the main character runs a butcher shop to earn money and take revenge. He captures people from the community that killed her, butchers them, and sells their body parts to zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This game contains excessive gore, dismemberment, and dark themes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coldwater</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A safe zone where what's left of humanity tries to rebuild civilization. Here, you can trade goods, decorate your home, and spend time in unique places like the local casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/52b10de82d0d30a9eab5f46964ce7aec.avif?t=1753195650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harrowpine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a peaceful town, now a hub for the undead. You run your butcher shop here\u2014capturing victims, processing them, and selling fresh human meat to hungry zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/ac49806311dafbeed7a54fb492c4fff2.avif?t=1753195650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ratwood</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rotting anarchist camp deep in the forest. The people who killed your daughter live here. Track them down, capture them, and drag them back to your shop to serve justice\u2026 and meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/c66286f8d1810fb94e46b51911e1fbc2.avif?t=1753195650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chop Your Victims</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture people from Ratwood, store them in prison cells, and prepare them for processing. Use chains and equipment to organize your butchering area efficiently.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/dfb0d232bae3e6eac8f7ec8f16c8c2e6.avif?t=1753195650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Butcher Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display body parts on your shelves and wait for the zombies to pay you in precious gold. Expand your shop with new sections, upgrade your equipment, and don\u2019t forget to add jars of eyeballs for that extra touch!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/51a3d18289cf4587d15141b32713153e.avif?t=1753195650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Run your old butcher shop to survive by selling human meat to zombies. Get closer to your daughter\u2019s killers with each step, seeking justice in a lawless world. In this flesh-fueled dystopia, you are the king of meat.",
